# Copy to ~/.config/tscatalog/.env next to the catalog. Gitignored. Process env wins over this file.
# Only TS_* keys are loaded from this file.
# start, stop, and detached processes do not inherit this file.
# Every TS_* variable is removed from their environment.
# status and logs still see the process environment.
# Compose can interpolate TS_*. A container receives one only if its
# Compose file passes it through.
#
# API access token (tskey-api-…), not a device auth key:
# https://tailscale.com/docs/reference/key-secret-management
# https://tailscale.com/docs/reference/tailscale-api#authentication
TS_API_KEY=tskey-api-...

# Alternative to an API key. The OAuth client needs the `all` scope:
# https://tailscale.com/docs/features/oauth-clients
# Tailscale's scope list has no narrower scope for /vip-services.
# TS_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# TS_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Defaults to the credential's tailnet:
# TS_TAILNET=-
